[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23474.11, "timestamp": "06:31:14", "text": "[音樂]永恆"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23478.07, "timestamp": "06:31:18", "text": "。  呃，希亞的笑容。  幸福。呃，降臨節。我選擇了冒險。  [音樂] 盡情發揮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23482.548, "timestamp": "06:31:22", "text": "想像力，感謝你們今天與我們分享這些消息"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23485.67, "timestamp": "06:31:25", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23511.19, "timestamp": "06:31:51", "text": "謝謝。也把球"}]